OL,3,GNEWSAI answer 999 calls while my dog
OL,4,Asleeps under my desk
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a busy 999 control room, filled with
OL,7,Fringing phones and urgent voices, a
OL,8,Fgentle snoring sound drifts from a
OL,9,Fcorner.
OL,11,FFast asleep under a desk lies Arnold -
OL,12,Fa "lazy" but loving guide dog.
OL,14,F"I think he's everyone's favourite in
OL,15,Fthe control room," says Sam Smith, an
OL,16,FEast Midlands Ambulance Service (EMAS)
OL,17,Fcall handler.
OL,19,F"He likes to sleep through my shifts."
